{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11101370","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11101370","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1110137001:1":{"text":"荒角沙漠好可怕！加入冬青学会后，我还从没来过这么危险的地方……","source_cn":"荒角沙漠好可怕！加入冬青学会后，我还从没来过这么危险的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABED7BD06A32B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110137002:1":{"text":"我已经后悔听了前辈的鬼话，加入这个课题——","source_cn":"我已经后悔听了前辈的鬼话，加入这个课题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417D3CBDE1622CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110137003:1":{"text":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","source_cn":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6603091533E3EE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110137003":{"text":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","source_cn":"糟、糟糕，我说得太大声了！等下会被前辈揍的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6603091533E3EE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110137004:1":{"text":"诶？前辈——！前辈你在哪里！为什么留下我一个人啊！","source_cn":"诶？前辈——！前辈你在哪里！为什么留下我一个人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CC06887744BC17D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_titl